     '"Skills is what an agent declares. Claude Code preloads only 1 to 4 of them into a subagent before its first turn; every other declared skill loads on demand through the Skill tool. Kiro CLI, and a top-level Claude Code agent, load every skill on demand.", "konductor declares 25 skills and preloads 2 on Claude Code (constraints, claude-teams-behavior). claude-teams-behavior is only in the spec\'s clientConfig.claudeCli block, so Kiro CLI never sees it.", "Five agents declare zero SOPs: product-manager',
